1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,380
From a small locality in Tripura to the big screen of Bollywood.

2
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:12,140
Tripura's Soumee Sailesh can now be heard in Salman Khan's film Maatrubhumi.

3
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,345
The song is called Madirapan.

4
00:00:20,385 --> 00:00:24,739
This is the story of a young woman from Chebri, Khowai

5
00:00:24,779 --> 00:00:29,580
who took her dream of music to Mumbai, about 2,000 km away.

6
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,270
Namaskar, I am Soumee Sailesh.

7
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:48,040
I am a girl from Khowai, Tripura.

8
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,430
I was born and raised on Tripura's soil.

9
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:55,275
Soumee Sailesh is also known as Sanhita Debnath.

10
00:00:55,315 --> 00:01:00,435
She was born in Tripura and grew up in Chebri, in Khowai district.

11
00:01:00,475 --> 00:01:05,020
Chebri lies a few kilometres from Khowai town.

12
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:10,885
Khowai district was carved out of West Tripura in 2012.

13
00:01:10,925 --> 00:01:13,970
Its northern edge is the international border with Bangladesh.

14
00:01:15,670 --> 00:01:18,785
Her bond with music began in childhood.

15
00:01:18,825 --> 00:01:22,120
Her first lessons in music came from her mother.

16
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:26,750
Since childhood, music has been my dream and my passion,

17
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:30,820
and a beautiful way to express my feelings and emotions.

18
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:38,290
She then trained in classical music as well as other musical forms.

19
00:01:38,330 --> 00:01:43,740
She later earned a Bachelor of Music degree from S.D. Barman College.

20
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:49,670
Tripura's link with Hindi film music goes back a long way.

21
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:54,575
The celebrated composer Sachin Dev Burman belonged to Tripura's royal family.

22
00:01:55,025 --> 00:02:00,675
His son, Rahul Dev Burman, also went on to become a major name in Hindi film music.

23
00:02:01,675 --> 00:02:05,860
Soumee, from the same land, also chose music as her path.

24
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:29,300
In 2017, Soumee moved to Mumbai to build a career as a professional singer.

25
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:33,590
The straight-line distance from Chebri to Mumbai is about 2,000 km.

26
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:38,160
One day, I left for Mumbai with that dream. The journey was not easy,

27
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:42,060
but I never lost faith in my dream and in music.

28
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:48,830
Mumbai's music industry is big, and the competition is just as tough.

29
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:53,495
Large numbers of artists from across India come here to find a place.

30
00:02:53,535 --> 00:02:57,270
Amid these challenges, Soumee kept working.

31
00:02:57,310 --> 00:03:04,840
She worked on television series, music albums, films, advertisements and live shows.

32
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:15,140
Then came a major opportunity.

33
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:18,575
Soumee Sailesh has sung playback on Madirapan

34
00:03:18,615 --> 00:03:22,280
a song from the Salman Khan-starrer Maatrubhumi.

35
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:27,660
In Hindi films, playback singers record the songs

36
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:30,450
and actors perform them on screen.

37
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:36,110
So the song's visuals show the film's actors, not Soumee.

38
00:03:38,510 --> 00:03:44,110
The song's music is by Himesh Reshammiya, and the lyrics are by Sameer Anjaan.

39
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:51,530
The official video credits Javed Ali, Mohd Danish and Soumee Sailesh as its singers.

40
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:13,040
Today, my song in Bollywood megastar Salman Khan sir's film Maatrubhumi,

41
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,460
Madirapan, sung in my voice, has been released.

42
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:19,300
This is a very special moment for me.

43
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:23,030
The composer is Himesh Reshammiya sir; the lyricist, Sameer Anjaan sir.

44
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:32,508
A chance to sing in a major banner's film is

45
00:04:32,548 --> 00:04:35,485
seen as important for any emerging singer.

46
00:04:35,525 --> 00:04:39,620
For Soumee, it is an important milestone in her musical journey.

47
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:45,100
Coming from Tripura to Mumbai, and from there the journey to Bollywood,

48
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:47,180
is not just an achievement for me.

49
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:51,420
It is the result of many years of dreams, hard work and patience.

50
00:04:57,820 --> 00:05:01,200
Soumee has big dreams for the road ahead.

51
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:06,245
She wants to establish herself as a recognised playback singer.

52
00:05:06,285 --> 00:05:10,762
She wants to try her voice in romantic, soulful

53
00:05:10,802 --> 00:05:14,550
emotional, rock and contemporary music.

54
00:05:15,050 --> 00:05:19,840
One of her big dreams is to work with composer A.R. Rahman.

55
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:25,590
Within the next five years, she wants to build a distinct identity in music.

56
00:05:27,990 --> 00:05:30,850
This is only the beginning. My dreams are big.

57
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:33,890
And my journey with music still has a long way to go.

58
00:05:35,090 --> 00:05:39,590
Her message to young people choosing music is clear.

59
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:45,075
Believe in your dreams, practise consistently and be patient.

60
00:05:45,115 --> 00:05:48,090
Do not be afraid of rejection or failure.

61
00:05:56,390 --> 00:05:59,369
Though she lives in Mumbai, Soumee has a deep

62
00:05:59,409 --> 00:06:02,630
emotional bond with Tripura, where she was born.

63
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:06,890
To everyone who has always stood by me and supported me,

64
00:06:06,930 --> 00:06:10,530
and loved my songs, I am very grateful.

65
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:13,640
I hope that in the days ahead, too,

66
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:16,630
you will always stand by me on this journey. Thank you.

67
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:37,464
A musical journey that began in a small locality of

68
00:06:37,504 --> 00:06:41,195
Tripura has now reached the music of a Bollywood film.

69
00:06:41,235 --> 00:06:45,990
From Chebri to Bollywood, Soumee Sailesh's journey continues.

